                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Gabriele"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "a762942f-c8cb-4936-aa94-3b56ff40e9c3",
                        "entry_id": "7c7f69e7-94f2-3530-a371-20aacf3ab9c7",
                        "tags": [
                            "depreciative",
                            "nominative",
                            "vocative",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "Gabriele"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4aab561e-7127-3b88-a24c-63c6efb2cb89",
                        "entry_id": "7c7f69e7-94f2-3530-a371-20aacf3ab9c7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "imię męskie"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4ff8a9b2-4af5-43e0-b522-bbd8f05b35a0",
                                "sense_id": "4aab561e-7127-3b88-a24c-63c6efb2cb89",
                                "text": "Mój młodszy brat ma na imię Gabriel."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5c44c59b-786c-49da-be8c-0a87ce38b290",
                                "sense_id": "4aab561e-7127-3b88-a24c-63c6efb2cb89",
                                "text": "Wśród polityków jest kilku naukowców, jak Władysław Grabski, Ignacy Mościcki, Gabriel Narutowicz, Leszek Balcerowicz czy Zbigniew Brzeziński, ludzi z tytułami profesorskimi znajdujemy w niemal każdej grupie"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0aa3610d-52bf-40b6-a4e6-ccee997faa12",
                                "sense_id": "4aab561e-7127-3b88-a24c-63c6efb2cb89",
                                "text": "W szóstym miesiącu Bóg posłał anioła Gabriela do miasta galilejskiego zwanego Nazaret"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5e0144f0-0c78-4b3e-a5bf-9adcce54eb6d",
                                "sense_id": "4aab561e-7127-3b88-a24c-63c6efb2cb89",
                                "text": "W Kościele katolickim na 29 września przypada wspomnienie św. Gabriela Archanioła, wysłannika i interpretatora Bożej woli."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ea4fd24-22fe-469b-aff0-b758851f9d80",
                                "sense_id": "4aab561e-7127-3b88-a24c-63c6efb2cb89",
                                "text": "Zapraszamy na spotkanie z niezwykłym człowiekiem, z archimandrytą o. Gabrielem ze wsi Odrynki nad Narwią (woj. podlaskie), który jest prawosławnym mnichem, zielarzem, budowniczym drewnianej cerkwi i prawosławnej pustelni, duchowym przewodnikiem"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f6d780f4-60bc-4744-b56d-f74000933c71",
                                "sense_id": "4aab561e-7127-3b88-a24c-63c6efb2cb89",
                                "text": "Gabrielowie dzień swego patrona, czyli imieniny, obchodzą 29 września, a także 24 marca."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "06883cf3-5227-4c2b-b922-f62ce77e268d",
                        "source_entry_id": "7c7f69e7-94f2-3530-a371-20aacf3ab9c7",
                        "source_sense_id": "4aab561e-7127-3b88-a24c-63c6efb2cb89",
                        "target_lang_word": "Gabriel",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Gabriel",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78d410f1-af00-3161-9fd6-7b7043d3ddf0",
                                        "entry_id": "c1137a10-4d2a-3948-a644-a0259fd9a051",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A male given name from Latin [in turn from Ancient Greek, in turn from Hebrew]."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "01b515a1-812d-46d9-9d0b-fa108c072cf4",
                                                "sense_id": "78d410f1-af00-3161-9fd6-7b7043d3ddf0",
                                                "text": "Yea, it seems to me not fit for Christian humility to call a man Gabriel or Michael, giving the names of angels to the sons of mortality."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e74b55d4-1c7c-4706-9245-1300ac86248b",
                                                "sense_id": "78d410f1-af00-3161-9fd6-7b7043d3ddf0",
                                                "text": "\"I'm the only Gabriel in the whole school,\" I told my father. \"You don't have to whisper it from the tomb, lad. You should thank your mother and me for giving you a handle that people notice. You ought to be pleased, not down in the dumps. Backstreet Gabriels aren't bumped into on every corner, remember."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "421dfc4d-d2da-3c68-bea2-2aa8bdf8a5ba",
                                        "entry_id": "c1137a10-4d2a-3948-a644-a0259fd9a051",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A male given name from Latin [in turn from Ancient Greek, in turn from Hebrew].",
                                            "An archangel associated in Judaism, Christianity and Islam, with carrying messages from God."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "474bdfd3-f04d-41a9-84c8-25cc293b9337",
                                                "sense_id": "421dfc4d-d2da-3c68-bea2-2aa8bdf8a5ba",
                                                "text": "Yea, whiles I was speaking in prayer, even the man Gabriel, whom I had seen in the vision at the beginning, being caused to fly swiftly, touched me about the time of the evening oblation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c68a389b-5bf4-47a5-8d12-22984248cd75",
                                                "sense_id": "421dfc4d-d2da-3c68-bea2-2aa8bdf8a5ba",
                                                "text": "And in the sixth month the angel Gabriel was sent from God unto a city of Galilee, named Nazareth,"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0fccd9c4-4d35-3f27-b787-a8a16d6b144f",
                                        "entry_id": "c1137a10-4d2a-3948-a644-a0259fd9a051",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A surname originating as a patronymic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
